WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:35.700
Karin-chan's Mysterious Ring

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:08.390
We found it! The seed of chaos!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.100
Hurry and destroy it!

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:16.690
Karin!

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.820
Are you alright, Karin?

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:24.300
Thanks, Kazune-kun!

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.410
I'm so glad that you're safe, my goddess.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.240
- What do you think you're doing?!

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:28.240
- Stop it you two!

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.240
Now isn't the time for this!

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.330
Destroying the seed of chaos comes first!

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:37.670
If we don't take care of it now, it'll become a big problem.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:41.920
Leave it to us. Our powers alone will be enough.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:48.510
Latreia! In the name of Hades…

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:53.310
Latreia! In the name of Neptune…

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:58.150
Latreia! In the name of Uranus…

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:02.360
We offer the ecstasy of love before you!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:28.590
What?

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:30.470
Our attacks had no effect?

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:34.430
This seed is different than the rest we've fought before.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:42.360
It's futile. They can't harm the matured seed with their current power.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.940
Right, onii-sama?

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:46.690
God, open the gate before me!

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:51.540
Make sure you stop their love for good!

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.790
I am God!

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.600
Karin, assist us!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:14.220
Okay!

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:17.600
With the power of love, Love Attack!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.440
Something is wrong with the Clock of Chronos!

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:43.880
Karin!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.660
It'll be okay. We'll definitely meet again.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.100
Where… is this?

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:49.940
What was I just doing?

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.670
Shii-chan…

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.840
Karin, what's with this mark?

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:19.810
I'm raising you because you're a relative but you're stupid and useless!

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:24.850
I-I'm sorry Auntie…

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:29.230
Shii-chan…

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.280
Thanks, Shii-chan…

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:41.080
Even though mom and dad are gone, I still have you.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:43.200
I'm not alone.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.170
I'm all alone now.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.220
God…

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.890
What're you doing?

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.980
What a cool boy!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.150
Was there a boy like him around here?

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:07.940
Hey.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.150
He has the aura of a prince from a fairy tale…

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:11.850
Hey!

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:13.230
Y-Yes!

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:16.240
I've been trying to ask… What are you doing at a place like this?

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:23.370
Well… I'm making a grave… for my pet Shii-chan…

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.290
Huh? Are you an idiot?

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.250
I'm not an idiot! Try saying that again!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:39.430
Sorry to bother you.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:42.220
Man how annoying…

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.970
Girls are so damn annoying.

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:46.450
You sexist male!

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:48.980
Hey, you! Wait!

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.520
You see, Shii-chan is my…

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:59.410
Of course I'd cry, because…

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:03.910
I'm all alone now.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.420
Karin-chan, your pet died?

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:16.130
You should just buy a new one.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.380
Cheer up!

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.050
What do you want as a new pet?

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:21.300
I'd like a dog.

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:28.310
Shii-chan must surely be watching over me with God in heaven.

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:34.150
I should keep trying my best!

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:36.360
Bad! Last place!

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:43.780
I'm the worst…

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:48.750
Auntie's going scold me again…

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:53.170
Shii-chan won't be there to comfort me…

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:58.880
Dad, Mom, Shii-chan…

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.340
Are you an idiot?

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:07.640
I remembered that sexist jerk! Next time I'll…

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.110
She sure is a pretty kid.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.480
Sorry…

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:20.740
I should be apologizing!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.320
Are you alright?

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:26.530
Such cute accessories, and her make-up's cool too…

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.580
Were you crying?

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.130
Uhmm…

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:38.700
Here!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:39.960
Thanks.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:43.760
She's so cute! I'm a little envious!

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:48.390
Those accessories and make-up are great! Where'd you buy them?

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:52.020
Did I just ask something weird?..

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.060
Would you like to try some on?

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:56.270
No, I didn't mean to ask that!

00:09:56.470 --> 00:10:00.150
It's not good to cry, especially when you're so cute.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.820
Even if you flatter me, I can't give you anything!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:07.070
It's okay, you're really cute.

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.500
Waa~ you look wonderful!

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:23.630
My name is Kujyou Himeka.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.800
I'm Karin! Pleased to meet you.

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.810
This is the first time I've received something like this.

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:36.650
I don't have parents, so…

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.150
What? Really?

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:38.900
Yes.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:39.900
Look!

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.280
What a pretty ring!

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:50.830
My pet passed away so this ring that my Mother left me is all I have left.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:51.870
Is that so?

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:52.830
Yeah.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:57.040
I also don't have parents.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:00.840
So I've been living with my cousin.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.670
We're the same.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:04.340
Himeka-chan's like me?

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:08.010
But she's this cute and kind?

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:11.220
I've always been acting like I was the only unfortunate one…

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.220
What's wrong?

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:13.600
It's nothing…

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.480
Kazune-chan!

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:23.400
Karin-chan, this is my cousin Kujyou Kazune-chan.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:27.210
Kazune-chan, this is Karin-chan.

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:30.240
So your name is Kazune-san?

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.460
It must be fate that we meet again!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:39.330
I'll have my revenge now!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:43.840
The girl from last night… you still got a problem?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.800
Girls can be so persistent.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.260
Girls this, girls that…

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:51.220
Apologize to Shii-chan you sexist jerk!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.970
Do you know each other?

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:58.100
It can't be… Karin-chan is the goddess we've been searching for?

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:03.070
Are you stupid? No way she's the one.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:06.490
What you talking about? What's this about a goddess?

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:10.030
Shut up! It's none of your business.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.990
Don't try to get involved in other's conversations.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.870
You're really an insensitive girl, aren't you?

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.330
I'm sorry. I apologize.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.540
I might have gone too far.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.710
There are better ways to talk to people you know…

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.760
You sexist jerk!

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:34.220
This ring…

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:38.730
Let go! This is a precious memento of my mother!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.940
I won't let people like you touch it!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:41.940
Let me see it for a moment, please!

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:44.020
No!

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:00.730
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:04.270
I am God!

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.230
You moron.

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.230
It's a croquette!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:22.980
Are you alright?

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.810
What did you do!

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.900
Karin-chan…

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:47.210
What… did he do to my ring?

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:50.170
If it's broken, I'm really going to get him!

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:05.350
Huh? What's going on?

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.690
I'm running so fast…

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:11.950
What are these intense feelings?

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:15.700
It feels weird… what's going on?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.160
Karin-chan, good morning!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:21.830
Good morning.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:24.150
What happened to you, Karin-chan?

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:26.250
You seem different than usual today.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:30.420
You look cute with that new hairstyle, but it's not just that…

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:33.590
Really? I didn't do anything though.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:38.510
What is this energy I'm radiating?

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.560
Karin-chan got a perfect score?!

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.140
Impossible!

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.780
Karin-chan can play the piano like that?!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.410
No way!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.710
Sensei! Karin-chan made a rainbow!

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:10.880
Unbelievable!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:15.170
Power, confidence, freedom… it all seems to be swelling up inside me!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:24.430
Shii-chan, it looks like God hasn't abandoned me.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:31.360
No… it's like there's a goddess inside me.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.280
But why am I feeling so good?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.990
It's a bit weird.

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:41.950
Maybe it's because the ring shone…

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.040
It's a little scary…

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.050
Karin-chan, it's gym next!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.300
Let's hurry and get changed!

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.750
I see, it's gym next.

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:05.020
Another marathon? I don't want to…

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:07.310
It's so sunny outside.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.230
I wish a storm would come, so they'd cancel it.

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.440
Just kidding!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:18.700
There's no way that could happen.

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:20.610
I better go get changed.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.870
Hey, look at the sky…

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.580
What?

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:38.010
What a storm!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:41.800
No way! It was so clear just a moment ago!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:46.220
I'm sure God did this for us, so our marathon would be cancelled!

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:08.540
I wonder what that was going on… with today.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.000
I wonder what that was going on… with today.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.420
Rain, please stop!

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:29.640
Nothing's happening, except that it stops and starts.

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:35.270
I wonder if it really was just a coincidence…

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:46.330
After all that's happened today, I'm exhausted.

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:02.670
At time like this… if Shii-chan was here…

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:11.520
Hey Shii-chan! Something weird happened at school today!

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:16.690
I got a perfect score and suddenly a storm came and cancelled gym!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.650
Surprising, isn't it?

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:24.070
It seems I'm all alone.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:30.990
It's okay! I'm not alone! I've made a new friend named Himeka-chan!

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.090
Thank goodness.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:38.290
Himeka-chan!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.930
You forgot your bag.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.990
I saw your address on your keychain.

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:50.430
Sorry to have you come all this way.

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:53.390
That's what friends are for.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:55.390
Thanks…

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:58.270
Himeka-chan! Why don't we hang out tomorrow?

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:01.530
I'll show you all of my accessories!

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:05.700
I'm sorry, but I have to go back already…

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:11.450
Kazune-chan and I only came to this city for some business.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:14.580
But now we've finished…

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:15.790
I see…

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.960
Then I'll see you off!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:27.470
Take care, Himeka-chan!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.810
Next time, you can come over to my place, okay?

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.520
Don't misunderstand!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.730
I just came to see Himeka-chan off, not you!

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:42.940
Has anything weird happened since the other day?

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:47.030
Since the ring shone, have any strange people appeared?

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.240
W-What are you talking about?

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:53.200
Even if something did happen, it's none of your business!

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.200
So something happened, didn't it?

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:02.880
"He" might come. If anything happens, tell me.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.920
If "he" comes, it'll be when you're alone.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.180
I'll be okay, leave me alone!

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:13.810
You this, you that, I'm Karin.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.930
Don't treat people like objects.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.230
Little silly, you'll catch a cold.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:26.150
Sorry. Just forget about me.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.530
I don't want to ruin your life.

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:33.280
I'm really sorry.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:41.380
Karin, I'm glad that I met you, even if it was short.

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.890
Kazune-kun?

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:04.070
That ring is a precious memento, right?

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.020
Y-Yeah…

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:07.690
Treasure it well, Goodbye.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:10.360
Goodbye, Karin-chan.

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.360
Wait!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:20.620
Kazune-kun… Himeka-chan…

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:44.690
Shii-chan…

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:58.200
It turns out, that I really am all alone.

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:14.680
I've finally found you.

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:26.730
I've been looking for you, goddess.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.600
Karin-chan transforms into a Mini-Goddess

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:08.040
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:12.050
Karin-chan transforms into a Mini-Goddess!

00:24:12.050 --> 00:24:15.390
What? I'm going to become a Mini-Goddess?

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:19.130
No way, no way! What am I going to do?
